  "notes": "WebAudio configurable render quantum enables trade-offs between low-latency processing and CPU overhead via renderSizeHint on AudioContext and OfflineAudioContext, exposing the resulting quantum via renderQuantumSize on BaseAudioContext and inside AudioWorkletGlobalScope."
